Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.41,0:00:03.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you sure this is the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:05.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think this is it, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh well, figure it out once you get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:08.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:37.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So how did it go?\NWhat was {\i1}that{\i0} world like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:41.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,White-knuckle! If Asakaze hadn't been there, we'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:43.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you go again, acting cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagara found today's portal too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah? That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's his 13th one this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:00:59.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All coincidences, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. Coincidences.\NIt just sort of happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:07.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coincidences, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:11.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I put together this report on Nozomi's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:16.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had her observe the light that her\NCompass indicates for the past month,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:19.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I still haven't been able to figure out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:23.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how close we get,\Nit always maintains the same distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.07,0:01:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and there's nothing we can do to affect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:30.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It appears to exist in a domain that cannot be observed by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:33.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So how do we get to this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that is the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, Nozomi is the only one who can see this light, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:43.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does it even really exist to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:45.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:47.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.85,0:01:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but whether it's a way out is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's starting to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:02:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There may be other powers that we don't know about yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.37,0:02:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, investigating the worlds inside the school,\Nand perhaps what the light is,\Nmight reveal how we can get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:08.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what {\i1}is{\i0} this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:16.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And who exactly gave us these powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.05,0:02:26.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, Murayama,\Nwho had been missing, was found in the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Albeit under somewhat unusual circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:30.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here is a picture of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:32.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ew...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:33.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's like a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:36.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone here who might know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if this is a result of another new rule in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:41.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or if this happened because of someone's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:44.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:50.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This may be totally unrelated,\Nbut Inuyama also went missing about a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A week ago? Why didn't you say anything until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:57.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? I thought someone else would notice and say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:03:00.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guess nobody was missing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:08.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He may have gotten himself into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:11.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We also need to investigate this freezing phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:12.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.27,0:03:17.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unlike a certain someone,\Nwe don't have the time or any special powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:19.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:26.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to work, and you've got the time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would it hurt to work with the others a little more—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.74,0:03:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.87,0:03:33.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, shall we vote on it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:34.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice and fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:38.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh. Then please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's too much for just one person, so can I ask for an assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:53.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm going to be much help with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be quiet for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:03.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, so I was thinking of streaming a new game today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.65,0:04:05.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and so I've settled on this! Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:06.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this guy for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:08.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.07,0:04:09.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-He's streaming a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:11.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.83,0:04:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever, let's go find the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.09,0:04:29.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you Inuyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:35.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're Inuyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.27,0:04:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like Mura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:39.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he streaming a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.85,0:04:41.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:43.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...two... {\alpha&HFF&}three... four...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.49,0:04:50.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-He's working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:58.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got it—\Nwhat these two frozen guys have in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:04:59.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're both guys that nobody notices whether they're there or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:05.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why nobody raised a big fuss when they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:11.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, there's not much we can do until we figure out what's causing the freezing in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's start with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.01,0:05:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:17.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Investigation lesson one: question involved parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.65,0:05:25.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, let me make one thing clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the boss, and you're just my assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.99,0:05:31.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so keep quiet and do what I tell you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:40.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This one's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it, it's my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:51.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could give stuff to everyone else for free too, you know.\NWhy put them through the\Ntrouble of settling payments?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.47,0:05:54.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because right here and now, this is reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.47,0:05:58.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did rich people give you stuff for free back in the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:00.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I know, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:02.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, you got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.35,0:06:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the app, if you don't pay back every little bit that you owe,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your stuff ends up burning to a crisp in that blue fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:13.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which makes it so everyone has to work all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.61,0:06:16.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said, no different than how it was before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.99,0:06:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when you laze about for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is reality in a capitalist society. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.29,0:06:28.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mura?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He seemed fine.\NThere was no sign that anything was particularly off with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:37.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's turned pitch-black and stopped moving, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:40.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't think it's some weird disease, do you? Could it be contagious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.14,0:06:43.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No slacking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.56,0:06:45.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard he used to stream games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:52.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently he didn't even have a single subscriber, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does that have anything to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:58.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inuyama? Inuyama, Inuyama...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.66,0:07:02.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He {\i1}was{\i0} here until not too long ago.\NYou don't know anything about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:04.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:06.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He went drifting off, too. I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.63,0:07:09.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it. We're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:10.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's have some fun together.\NI'd love to get to know you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:18.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not me, but my power, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Mizuho,\Nwhat are your cats doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:35.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They aren't mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are actually my grandma's cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But my grandma got dementia,\Nand wound up in a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But nobody wanted to look after these guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.63,0:07:51.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I heard they were going to get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.17,0:07:54.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I stuffed them in my bag and took them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:07:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna tell the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.09,0:08:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I won't. And even if I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:05.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I could use my power before we went adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:18.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:20.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, how'd that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:23.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could only use it at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there were others who had powers besides me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:38.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A strange power you can use while at school...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:49.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.73,0:08:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:53.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a little curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:57.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was this caused by this world's rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.11,0:08:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or maybe someone's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:04.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're trapped here,\Nengulfed in flames, bound by a set of rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:06.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how it's been ever since we went adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:11.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if someone's testing us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:15.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And who could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.57,0:09:16.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:19.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You knew, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That the school would go adrift,\N and that we'd end up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:24.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're going to go adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.51,0:09:28.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It will be into a world governed by the absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:32.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Tell me all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:35.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:36.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a voice, you see, that tells me things.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was informed ahead of time.\NSort of like what questions will be on the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:43.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then the person behind that voice would have to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:46.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Indeed, who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:55.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're not going to find anything without Nagara around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just happen to be on an unlucky streak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:10:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't need him for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:02.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've been saying that for three days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:08.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tora, when did I order Ciao?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I asked you to bring me {\i1}canned{\i0} tuna, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:15.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that attitude for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.37,0:10:17.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine, no dinner for you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:20.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you growl at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.11,0:10:24.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, this is no time for games, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:26.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's been even more victims!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm working on it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, what do you have to show for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:37.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are Mizuho's findings...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:42.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the victims are oddballs,\Nand no one around them liked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.59,0:10:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has led her to believe this has occurred\Nbecause they were excluded from their groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody's probably picking on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:51.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean it's someone's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.77,0:10:55.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why don't we take a look at the power list?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:11:04.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hoshi asked us to survey everyone and put together a list of all our powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:04.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,just in case something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.45,0:11:06.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:11.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We want to check if there are any powers having to do with this freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:12.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a lot we're still not sure about,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:23.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we have a pretty good grasp of everyone's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:30.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be said that there are some powers with surprising effects,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:31.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and some that are surprisingly complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.97,0:11:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh, you're A-ranked?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:35.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:42.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My finger turns into a light! Isn't that amazing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.99,0:11:46.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That gets an A rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's awesome, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was in that movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm, there don't seem to be any powers that correlate with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:12:00.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not even sure if we can trust this list.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asakaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear you haven't cracked this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that Pony got angry at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's taking some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:14.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, it's all good if you don't join us again.{you don't have to go back there with us.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:15.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.81,0:12:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're doing fine without you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.35,0:12:23.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I just spoke to Nozomi,\Nwho said she was fine without you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.48,0:12:26.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? You upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:32.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if you really want, I could stick up for you,\Neven though you slow me down—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.87,0:12:34.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:36.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a load off. Okay, that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's perfectly fine.\N I'm the one who should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:45.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.31,0:13:01.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Kaga, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.69,0:13:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that about earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:12.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's he trying to talk you out of?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watching you back there really pissed me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:20.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for what?\NYou didn't mean a single thing you told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:22.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:27.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You actually think Asakaze is a scumbag, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.09,0:13:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to slug him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:31.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Buzz off, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine. It's not like I—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:35.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So lame. You don't even have the guts to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:39.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:36.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm Nagara, from Class 3. Do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.99,0:14:41.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone is worried and out looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:42.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.79,0:14:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, would you come back with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:47.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:50.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody's worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,True enough. No one cared one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:55.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nice to be one of the gifted, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so absurd, really—\Nalways getting pushed around by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kaga, how did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:03.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just kept thinking that I'd had enough of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.10,0:15:08.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and before I knew it, here I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before you knew it, you were here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:13.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure God must have granted me my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:15.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.47,0:15:17.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.49,0:15:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, these blackout curtains are connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.47,0:15:22.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? This isn't the only room?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody's watching you, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:31.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just playing your game all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.47,0:15:38.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In here I can spend my time on whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:43.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In here, even idiots can get away from being made fun of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:47.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:16:00.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the freeze really {\i1}is{\i0} some kind of rule in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:05.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serves me right for being worried.\NThese guys are just recluses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:06.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So do you think you can get the four of them out of there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:18.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if you do, will their\Ncreepy figures go back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probably. But they aren't going to come out on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:25.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what do we do, then?\NDo you have any practical measures you can take?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:30.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We could ask Asakaze to forcibly yank them out of there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:31.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That would solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:34.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said they don't want leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.65,0:16:36.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, so we lure them out with money and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:41.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I was thinking you were good for something,\Nbut I guess I was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from? I'm just—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:46.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is exactly why Nozomi is giving up on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:49.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:53.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know if she likes you or whatever,\Nbut she's been following you around like a puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It grosses me out just watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She does not! There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:17:00.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it doesn't bother me,\Nthen you should just leave it alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.43,0:17:01.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:03.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not for you, and not for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.76,0:17:06.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are some things you can't know until you meet them head-on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:11.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's it.\NI get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you said you'd conduct this investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:18.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanted to see how powerless you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:19.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were a recluse yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so you lied about having powers\Nbefore we came here to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:31.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just how messed up are you,\Nto keep charging people for everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:38.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.77,0:17:53.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear the investigation isn't going so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why the long face?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:07.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have come this far without you, Nagara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.66,0:18:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:14.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asakaze is nothing but talk.\NHe can't find anything on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are you doing? Close to solving your case?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.42,0:18:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We found the people who've been frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.76,0:18:26.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they all hate life here,\Nand seem to just be hiding from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.43,0:18:28.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where were they hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.43,0:18:33.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In a place with these blackout curtains hanging all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.77,0:18:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They keep going on for as far as I could see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:42.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amongst it all, though,\Nthere are a number of gaps, kind of like pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:44.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.47,0:18:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you saying that you found a portal to another world that wasn't in the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not quite sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:56.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the world you found in the audiovisual lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:07.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this another portal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That bonehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.93,0:19:14.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn, does he piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is so frustrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:25.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I went a bit too far as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone's raring to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:07.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a phenomenon created by this world's workings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:13.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Removing those who are excluded is one of its rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.91,0:20:18.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They didn't become reclusive—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.79,0:20:20.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(838,3215,\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&HFFF&\4a&HFFF&)}the truth is, they all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The depths of your heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.37,0:20:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are always hard to dredge up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.39,0:21:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And with that, the case is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.77,0:21:25.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.36,0:21:29.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what I said earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.78,0:21:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't really mean it.\NI just got snarky—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:33.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neither of us did, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:37.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, in any case...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:22:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The portal disappeared, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like it disappeared over at the school, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.37,0:22:09.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess it was {\i1}that{\i0} world that was causing the freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.53,0:22:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.36,0:22:15.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But how did those two even find another portal out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.87,0:22:17.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had a thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.33,0:22:21.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe Nagara does have a power...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.67,0:22:29.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and maybe it's the power to leap into new worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.97,0:22:34.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the portals are nothing more than the product of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:39.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh, is this another power relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:57.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A savior?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.49,0:22:59.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, who could that be?
